      "content": "That's interesting. So when you say \"character of the people,\" are you suggesting we should be looking at specific demographic compositions, like ethnic density or the percentage of certain racial groups in a given census tract, to refine the model's accuracy? I want to make sure we're capturing the statistical reality of these high-loss areas.",
